# Files and folders that HCP Terraform should not upload.
#
# This repository is the mobile application, around 186 MB and 4400+ files.
# Uploading all of it made every stack run fail with a source bundle too
# large error. Only infra/terraform is needed by the stack, so everything
# else is excluded here. Nothing is deleted from the repository, this only
# controls what gets sent to HCP Terraform.

